{"type":"text","timestamp":1772832362185,"sessionID":"ses_33af742c4ffezt0g6n9hWNRiki","part":{"id":"prt_cc50afe8e0017Xn22RsJjsYjQ7","sessionID":"ses_33af742c4ffezt0g6n9hWNRiki","messageID":"msg_cc50ad2fa001JlucKGiF6qqiLD","type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the codebase, I found several critical issues with the plan:\n\n```\nVERDICT: FAIL\nFEEDBACK:\n- CRITICAL: Client page auth missing - serveClientPage (api.go:530) does NOT validate dashboard key; it passes key to template without checkDashboardAuth call. Plan doesn't mention /clients/{id} route.\n- CRITICAL: Backend still sends all data when unauthenticated - api.go:139-153 fetches ALL clients and features regardless of auth status. Plan says \"serve minimal content\" but doesn't specify HOW to prevent data leakage.\n- Test expects failure - pwa_test.go:656 expects / to return non-200 when DashboardKey is set, but current implementation returns 200. Plan should ensure backend returns 401/redirect instead of 200.\n- Missing: No API endpoint to validate key before reload; frontend does blind location.reload() after saveKey()\n- Edge case: localStorage unavailable (private browsing) - plan doesn't handle this\n- Edge case: Invalid key after submission - plan doesn't specify feedback mechanism when wrong key entered\n- Confusing: Current index.html already uses {{if .Authenticated}} template conditional (line 210); CSS hiding (#dashboard-content) is redundant. Plan should clarify removing CSS vs template conditional.\n```","time":{"start":1772832362183,"end":1772832362183}}}
